{\|Q\|_{L^{p}(\mathbb{R}^{N})}^{p}}
=&
\frac{
\lambda_{1}^{2}\lambda_{2}^{2-N}
\|u\|_{D^{1,2}(\mathbb{R}^{N})}^{2}
}
{
\lambda_{1}^{p}\lambda_{2}^{-N}
